       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TGETSEQ.
       AUTHOR.        R L ENSMINGER.
       INSTALLATION.  GTR.
       DATE-COMPILED.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT JOBDESC
           ASSIGN TO DISK-MCFPMMJOBD
           ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
           ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
           FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  JOBDESC
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  JREC                             PIC X(10).

       EJECT
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  ANSWER                           PIC X.

       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.

       01  FILE-STATUS                      PIC XX.

       01  SUBMIT-PGM                       PIC X(10).

       01  SUBMIT-PARM                      PIC X(200).

       01  SUBMIT-JOB                       PIC X(10).

       01  SUBMIT-JOBD                      PIC X(10).

       01  SUBMIT-OUTQ                      PIC X(10).

       01  SUBMIT-USER                      PIC X(10).

       01  SCREEN1.
           COPY DD-SCREEN1 OF ZGETSEQ.

       COPY SCREENIO OF COPYLIB.

       01  TRUE-VAL                         PIC 1 VALUE B"1".

       EJECT
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       OPEN-PAR.
           OPEN INPUT JOBDESC.

           MOVE "ZGETSEQ" TO SCREEN-FILE.
           MOVE "Y" TO SCREEN-SW.
           MOVE SPACES TO SCREEN1.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.

           PERFORM GET-JOB-DESC.

           PERFORM SHOW-SCREEN.

           PERFORM JOB-SUBMIT.

           PERFORM END-PAR.

       EJECT
       END-PAR.
           CLOSE JOBDESC.

           GOBACK.

       EJECT
       GET-JOB-DESC.
           READ JOBDESC.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
             DISPLAY "ERROR: FILE STATUS = "
                     FILE-STATUS
                     " ON READ OF JOBDESC"
             ACCEPT ANSWER
             GO TO END-PAR.

       EJECT
       SHOW-SCREEN.
           MOVE "SCREEN1" TO SCREEN-NAME.
           MOVE  SCREEN1  TO SCREEN-BUFFER.

           CALL "TSCREEN" USING SCREEN-PARMS.

           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
             GO TO END-PAR.

           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER TO SCREEN1.

           IF KEY-HIT = 3
             GO TO END-PAR.

           IF HSEQUENCE OF SCREEN1-O NUMERIC
             NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
             MOVE 66093 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
             CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS
             MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO ERRMSG
             MOVE TRUE-VAL TO IND (99)
             GO TO SHOW-SCREEN.

       EJECT
       JOB-SUBMIT.
           MOVE "CLMMISHRET" TO SUBMIT-PGM.
           MOVE HSEQUENCE OF SCREEN1-O TO SUBMIT-PARM.
           MOVE "MMISHIST" TO SUBMIT-JOB.
           MOVE JREC TO SUBMIT-JOBD.
           MOVE "*JOBD" TO SUBMIT-OUTQ.
           MOVE "*JOBD" TO SUBMIT-USER.

           CALL "CLSUBMIT" USING SUBMIT-PGM
                                 SUBMIT-PARM
                                 SUBMIT-JOB
                                 SUBMIT-JOBD
                                 SUBMIT-OUTQ
                                 SUBMIT-USER.
